		(property "Description" "Raspberry Pi Pico 2 (RP2350A) soldered flat on the board as a module.  1-40: the edge pads; D1-D3: the debug pads; TP1-TP6: the test pads on its underside (TP2/TP3 USB, TP6 BOOTSEL; TP4 and TP5 must not be used).  The Pico 2 has a seventh test pad, TP7 (1.1 V, do not use): the footprint has no pad there and the board must show bare solder mask under it.  GP0-GP22 tolerate 5 V only while the module is powered, GP26-GP28 never do"
			(at 0 0.00 0)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
				(hide yes)
			)
		)
